<p>If you can afford to donate some money and want to support the Xiph.org Foundation, you may do so via Paypal by clicking on the icon below.</p>

<p style='text-align: center;'>
	<a href="https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr?cmd=_donations&business=donate@xiph.org&amp;item_name=Donation&amp;item_number=DONATE&amp;return=https://www.xiph.org"><img src="https://www.paypal.com/images/lgo/logo3.gif" alt="paypal logo"/></a>
</p>

<p>You can also send a check or money order to:</p><br/>
<div style="text-align: center;">
<b>Xiph.org Foundation</b><br/>
21 College Hill Road<br/>
Somerville MA 02144</div>
<br/>

